## Local secrets & environment
# `*.env` matches foo.env and `.env.*` matches .env.local, but neither matches a bare `.env`.
.env
*.env
.env.*
# The one exception, and it holds no secrets: it is the template of which variables a deployment
# has to set, and `docs/deployment.md` opens by telling you to copy it. Ignored by `.env.*` above
# without this line, which would leave a fresh clone with nothing to copy.
!.env.example
appsettings.Local.json
appsettings.*.Local.json
secrets.json

## Aspire
.aspire/

## Telemetry capture fixtures that are too large to track
*.telemetry.bin

## Dashboard frontend
node_modules/
# The dashboard's build output — client bundle and Node server, both regenerated by
# `npm run build`. Tracking either would put a minified bundle in every diff that touched the UI.
src/RaceIntelligence.Dashboard/dist/
# Vite's dependency pre-bundling cache, and TanStack Start's own scratch directory.
.vite/
src/RaceIntelligence.Dashboard/.tanstack/
src/RaceIntelligence.Dashboard/.nitro/

## graphify knowledge graph — derived entirely from the sources it indexes, so it is rebuilt
# rather than tracked (`graphify update`). The HTML and JSON are megabytes each and rewritten
# wholesale on every run, which no diff can usefully compress.
graphify-out/

## Claude Code — settings.json is shared config and is tracked; settings.local.json holds
# per-developer permissions and machine paths, so it stays local.
.claude/settings.local.json
# Harness-created git worktrees — a full second checkout of this repo.
.claude/worktrees/

